# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P2 Embers, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0. Evan's
# moves (2026-11-13), quickly: Osc/Sb to the sub, the sub to -4 oct, drone I's pitch down to 20.6 Hz, its level to 50
# so the clicks are percussion under drone II; then the clicks, held. "# @" marks the listening times (--times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tapkey w1
tap PLAY
wait 3000
wav ticks.wav
# @ Embers (P2) as it starts: no clicks
wait 1500
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
# @ Osc/Sb to the sub, the sub to -4 oct, drone I's pitch quickly down to about 21 Hz, its level down to 50
turn K1 70 15
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tap HOME
tap HOME
turn K1 -34 50
tap HOME
turn K1 -34 40
# @ Clicks, about 2.6 a second, as percussion under drone II's blooming triangle
wait 12000
wavstop
page 5
wait 400
shot ticks-0.png
page 1
wait 400
shot ticks-1.png
